WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:09.280
To connect your Companion, first get your code. On the welcome page, enter the email you subscribed with and tap Get code.

00:09.980 --> 00:14.588
Your 6-digit code appears. It lasts 1 hour.

00:15.290 --> 00:20.930
In the app, open Settings, enter the code, and tap Connect my companion.

00:21.630 --> 00:23.742
Your Companion is connected.

00:24.440 --> 00:34.040
If you lose your code, or it expires, just get a new one the same way. Enter your email on the welcome page and tap Get code again.
